ullback of the descent datum <MATH_0005> is simply\n<MATH_0006>\nPullback defined in this manner defines a functor from the category of\ndescent data over <MATH_0007> to the category of descend data over\n<MATH_0008>.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:96dccd7c0ff4025a6d39a5dca4bd9a4733cf45fdb52746930c39ab59b8c71b18", "unit_id": "inventory:spaces-groupoids:04MB:paragraph/0004"}}}, {"context_id": "locked-English-neighbor:spaces-groupoids:inventory:spaces-groupoids:044X:proof/0001", "hash": "sha256:1a679bdf51e55fac6c5f136bed96de7f3aa164c165929dc121d5b2aaf0fb1578", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 101239, "byte_start": 100922, "file": "spaces-groupoids.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:64380a4c65a11d85acaa9b91ba8f7ddecdb7381030751b1cd824e52873b6c857", "line_end": 2945, "line_start": 2937}, "owner_tag": "044X", "parent_tag": "04MB", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04MB", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-quotient-stack-morphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8ea5b7b07870ef5a89329510c2c2a4456b754cd8245c13713d544cc3663db473", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nStatement (1) is part of the construction of the stackyfication.\nPart (2) follows from\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nWe omit the verification of (3).\nPart (4) is a translation of the fact that in a stack all descent data\nare effective.\nWe omit the verifications of (5) and (6).\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c682ad6dac4f6cab80a8ae6af89f2cbe7cad03d2712f89ac64ef4530534f34a6", "unit_id": "inventory:spaces-groupoids:044X:proof/0001"}}}, {"c